{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09723","headline":"江行夜宿龙吼滩临眺思峨眉隐者兼寄幕中诸公 · 岑参","name":"江行夜宿龙吼滩临眺思峨眉隐者兼寄幕中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官舍临江口，滩声人惯闻。\n水烟晴吐月，山火夜烧云。\n且欲寻方士，无心恋使君。\n异乡何可住，况复久离羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}